data: {"draft_id":"7ee416cd-649b-4084-83e6-8445802d7934","template_id":"TPL-DOC-02","template_title":"Missing Documents Notice","template_version":"1.3","slots":{"letter_date":"13 November 2026","tenant_name":"Siva Dental Care Pte Ltd","contact_person":"Toh Mei Fen","application_id":"APP-2026-0294","application_type":"ALTERATION & ADDITION","unit_address":"Blk 642 Pasir Indah Avenue 6 #01-01 Singapura 510642","missing_documents_list":"- Method statement and work schedule (not submitted)\n- Contractor's all-risk insurance certificate (not submitted)","submit_by_date":"27 November 2026","officer_name":"Siti Aishah Yusof","officer_email":"siti.aishah@heb.example.org"},"unfilled":[{"slot":"letter_ref","reason":"PLG Records hold no letter reference: give one before sending."}],"pii":[],"html":"<p>Our ref: <mark>«letter_ref»</mark></p>\n<p>13 November 2026</p>\n<p>Siva Dental Care Pte Ltd<br>Attn: Toh Mei Fen</p>\n<p>Dear Toh Mei Fen,</p>\n<p>ALTERATION &amp; ADDITION APPLICATION APP-2026-0294 - OUTSTANDING DOCUMENTS (Blk 642 Pasir Indah Avenue 6 #01-01 Singapura 510642)</p>\n<p>Thank you for your application. We have reviewed the documents you submitted and need the following before we can continue:</p>\n<p>- Method statement and work schedule (not submitted)<br>- Contractor&#x27;s all-risk insurance certificate (not submitted)</p>\n<p>Please submit the documents by 27 November 2026 (14 days from the date of this letter) via email to siti.aishah@heb.example.org or at any HEB branch. Your application will be treated as withdrawn if we do not receive them by this date.</p>\n<p>Yours sincerely,</p>\n<p>Siti Aishah Yusof</p>\n<p>Tenancy Management</p>\n<p>Properties &amp; Land Group</p>","type":"draft","seq":7}

